  installRustTitle: 'Rust hosts',
  installRustBody: 'The Rust side exposes Connection, client and server facades so you can embed the engine or assemble your own local service.',
  installRustNote: 'API documentation lives on docs.rs/yydb. Format and compatibility rules are in the encoding chapter of the project documentation.',

  installBrowserTitle: 'Browser engine',
  installBrowserBody: '@yydb/light-db runs the Rust semantic core compiled to WASM. Durable sessions write to OPFS and in-memory sessions are also supported.',
  installBrowserNote: 'The browser entry point exposes neither the SQLite snapshot reader nor Node built-ins.',

  installClientTitle: 'Remote client',
  installClientBody: 'Use @yydb/yydb-client against a running yydb serve. The browser entry speaks WebSocket and the Node TCP entry is imported from a subpath.',
  installClientNodeNote: 'The Node TCP entry point is @yydb/yydb-client/node.',

