  installSecurityTitle: 'Secure defaults',
  installSecurityBody: 'Reference yydb serve has no login, tenant, role or authorization layer. Anyone who can reach the endpoint can read and write the database. The trust boundary is the process location and OS file permissions. Use YYDS when you need auth, audit and quotas.',

